                "text": "@RepBobOnder \u201cFifteen years ago, the Affordable Care Act (ACA) was signed into law, and as a doctor, I am uniquely qualified to say it has moved our health care system in the wrong direction. Premiums have gone up by 150 percent, and hardworking Missouri families have lost control over their healthcare. That\u2019s completely unacceptable. The American people deserve real, affordable, high-quality care that puts patients, not Washington bureaucrats, first.\u201d",
